flowchart TB
  PN[Peer news before cutoff] --> FIT[NLP fitting before RL]
  PL[Mature peer return labels] --> FIT
  FIT --> SM[Sentiment model]
  FIT --> IM[Impact model]
  TN[Target news] --> SCORE[Target text scoring]
  SM --> SCORE
  IM --> SCORE
  SCORE --> SIG[Signals available before open]
  MP[Target OHLCV] --> MF[Prior-close market features]
  MF --> C[Market-only DQN]
  MF --> N[DQN with one text signal]
  SIG --> N
  C --> E[Common ledger and evaluation]
  N --> E
  MP --> BH[Buy-and-Hold]
  BH --> E
  E --> UI[Dashboard and report]
  DB[(SQLite / run artifacts)]
  E -.-> DB
